  triage:description "tests.rs:10 imports connect_daemon_local_ipc_until_ready from test_support as part of a combined use statement with LifecycleFlagResetGuard. connect_daemon_local_ipc_until_ready is #[cfg(unix)]-gated in test_support.rs; the import is not gated, causing Windows E0432. Fix: split the use statement and gate the connect_daemon_local_ipc_until_ready import with #[cfg(unix)]. Same cfg(unix) gate pattern as S13-CI-001." ;
